==========stdout==========
g> g> Goodbye!
==========stderr==========
Cannot create the * edge without a label (repair 2 below), and even with one this path has 2 possible repairs. mk does not fall back to a repair that needs no label; nothing was changed. Give the edge a literal label, or pin a node with @N or exclude one with !{@N} to choose a repair. (UnsupportedLabel)
  1. @000000000000 -"a"-> new1
    creates: @000000000000 -"a"-> new1
  2. @000000000000 -*-> new1
    creates: @000000000000 -*-> new1

